  {
    "title": "圆与切线的几何证明",
    "content": "<p>如图，AB为⊙O的直径，弦CD⊥AB，垂足为点E，CF⊥AF，且CF=CE．</p>\r\r<p><img src=\"Assets/68782ad3fa03d7aafa18017c4e900c2466d9572cd8d3f8cef388734788aa1a82.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"162\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\r<p>（1）求证：CF是⊙O的切线；</p>\r\r<p>（2）若<img src=\"Assets/44f09186f861cd2ee228c9567c563cc71a22152b1117cdd6aaa7dc0c95f9dca7.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">，求<img src=\"Assets/3dbf1fe736cda846045917d009eb8839de8ba1ef21fd1f8005deb569b859e2a4.png\" width=\"43\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\">的值</p>\r\r<p> </p>",
    "answer": "【答案】\r\r\r\r\r\r<p>(1)证明见解析；（2）<img src=\"Assets/8ec3c382d8c3a1e6df18e001a0bb465af01e7c3d0c33a3c85a143a7a6b523e85.png\" width=\"22\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">.</p>\r\r<p></p>",
    "analysis": "<p></p>\r\r<p>试题分析：（1）首先连接OC，由CD⊥AB，CF⊥AF，CF=CE，即可判定AC平分∠BAF，由圆周角定理即可得∠BOC=2∠BAC，则可证得∠BOC=∠BAF，即可判定OC∥AF，即可证得CF是⊙O的切线；</p>\r\r<p>（2）由垂径定理可得CE=DE，即可得S<sub>△</sub><sub>CBD</sub>=2S<sub>△</sub><sub>CEB</sub>，由△ABC∽△CBE，根据相似三角形的面积比等于相似比的平方，易求得△CBE与△ABC的面积比，继而可求得<img src=\"Assets/8daa88ffe9e09b68993783c3854d985dc112442d037a91524a7a1bec5fbbd737.png\" width=\"37\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\">的值．</p>\r\r<p>试题解析：（1）证明：连接OC．</p>\r\r<p><img src=\"Assets/f194e477fcac0b4bab1482e89b21bfa930fee6f7f8214299d5d34ffffe2dfe33.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"162\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\r<p>∵CE⊥AB，CF⊥AF，CE=CF，</p>\r\r<p>∴AC平分∠BAF，即∠BAF=2∠BAC．</p>\r\r<p>∵∠BOC=2∠BAC，</p>\r\r<p>∴∠BOC=∠BAF．</p>\r\r<p>∴OC∥AF．</p>\r\r<p>∴CF⊥OC．</p>\r\r<p>∴CF是⊙O的切线．</p>\r\r<p>（2）【解析】<br>∵AB是⊙O的直径，CD⊥AB，</p>\r\r<p>∴CE=ED，∠ACB=∠BEC=90°．</p>\r\r<p>∴S<sub>△</sub><sub>CBD</sub>=2S<sub>△</sub><sub>CEB</sub>，∠BAC=∠BCE，</p>\r\r<p>∴△ABC∽△CBE．</p>\r\r<p>∴<img src=\"Assets/8daa88ffe9e09b68993783c3854d985dc112442d037a91524a7a1bec5fbbd737.png\" width=\"37\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\">=<img src=\"Assets/7f5ba4b6db0eeaac43923e80b9398a225630d402368fbef769878d1b73c316c6.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">=（sin∠BAC）<sup>2</sup>=<img src=\"Assets/16b6401ac6c2db839818e0aef5597476a7eb85d21538217287493493df51b015.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">=<img src=\"Assets/d608e5d0a4b6a993130ee113dbb5729e4793ff18000c264089a4b8502ea1577f.png\" width=\"22\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">．</p>\r\r<p>∴<img src=\"Assets/8daa88ffe9e09b68993783c3854d985dc112442d037a91524a7a1bec5fbbd737.png\" width=\"37\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\">=<img src=\"Assets/8ec3c382d8c3a1e6df18e001a0bb465af01e7c3d0c33a3c85a143a7a6b523e85.png\" width=\"22\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\">．</p>\r\r<p>考点: 1.切线的判定；2.圆周角定理；3.相似三角形的判定与性质.</p>\r\r<p> </p>",
