  {
    "title": "圆的综合计算与证明",
    "content": "如图，BC是⊙O的直径，A是弦BD延长线上一点，切线DE平分AC于E．<br>（1）求证：AC是⊙O的切线；<br>（2）若AD：DB=3：2，AC=15，求⊙O的直径．<br><br><img src=\"Assets/d6a12082d9c85db5fc72fa735b03e4466813ce41618c395389c9e2abf8f7cb3a.png\" loading=\"lazy\">",
    "answer": "【答案】（1）要证AC是⊙O的切线，只要证∠BCA=90°即可；<br>（2）切割线定理得出关于AD，AB的比例式，求出AB的长，再用勾股定理求出求⊙O的直径．<br><img src=\"Assets/08ccf9e326ff555f9a4a9530aaeb9035ee7e72644de0510330ed3a2eff51ea7a.png\" loading=\"lazy\">（1）证明：连接OD，CD；<br>∵切线DE平分AC于E，<br>∴∠ODE=90°，<br>∵BC是⊙O的直径，<br>∴在Rt△ADC中DE=CE；<br>∵OE=OE，OD=OC，<br>∴△ODE≌△OCE，<br>∴∠ACB=90°，<br>∴AC是⊙O的切线．<br><br>（2）</p>",
    "analysis": "<p><br>∵AC是⊙O的切线；<br>∴AC•AC=AD•AB=AD•（AD+BD）AD：DB=3：2，<br>∴AD=3<img src=\"Assets/0bcba9ccd465327f66ceecd29d501f622fd2e94cf3934ffcddf91d972626e67c.png\" loading=\"lazy\">，AB=5<img src=\"Assets/0bcba9ccd465327f66ceecd29d501f622fd2e94cf3934ffcddf91d972626e67c.png\" loading=\"lazy\">，<br>∴BC=5<img src=\"Assets/c7243ec53bdc9c8c95e4c17559f4bd901107f182a9025d3f9386dcdf240f72b7.png\" loading=\"lazy\">．<br>",
